  "doorExtraction": "Actual source body UVs, dark door panes and interior handles are clipped into four UV-preserving panels. Chrome entrance guardrails stay fixed on the body. Matching rectangles are removed from static side walls, leaving openings. No generic replacement door texture is used.",
