  "transparency": "Source triangle materials were opaque and one-sided; retained opaque surfaces require no transparency pass.",
  "surfaceBatching": "High retains original diffuse maps on retained surfaces. Medium retains side livery, end doors and bogie photo maps; low retains side livery and end doors. Other detail textures are approximated by their linear mean base colors and normal maps omitted for medium/low. Nearly uniform rough-metal grain becomes its mean roughness scalar. Untextured surfaces merge using per-vertex colors and shared roughness .7; retained textures preserve original UVs.",
